// Castle-layout archetypes (roadmap M52; doc 07 §5 — the "template-based skeletons"
// finally load-bearing). Offsets from the keep centre; entries build IN ORDER, one
// structure per day as the capital's stores allow. Tiles the local ground refuses
// (rock, water) are skipped — nature already walls them (the terrain adaptation).
